        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.26+1KI.10.27+1KI.10.28+1KI.10.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abami 10.26-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nuko Salomo ava ku kanunga k'i Gibeyoni imbere y'ihema ry'ibonaniro, agaruka i Yerusalemu ategeka Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.5.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abami 5.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Salomo ateranya amagare n'abagendera ku mafarashi, kandi yari afite amagare igihumbi na magana ane n'abagendera ku mafarashi inzovu n'ibihumbi bibiri, abishyira mu midugudu bacyuragamo amagare n'i Yerusalemu ku murwa w'umwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi i Yerusalemu umwami ahagwiza ifeza n'izahabu bitekerezwa ko ari nk'amabuye, n'ibiti by'imyerezi atuma binganya n'imivumu yo mu bibaya ubwinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guteg 17.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi amafarashi Salomo yari atunze yavaga muri Egiputa, abacuruzi b'umwami bayaguraga ari amashyo, ishyo ryose riciriwe igiciro cyaryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku igare rimwe ryazamukaga rikava muri Egiputa batangaga shekeli z'ifeza magana atandatu, ku ifarashi batangaga ijana na mirongo itanu. Ni ko bajyaga babitundira n'abami b'Abaheti n'ab'i Siriya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
